OL,3,AHealey pledges cheaper marmalade and
OL,4,Agherkins in pre-Budget package of
OL,5,A'everyday fixes'
OL,6,
OL,7,FJohn Healey will remove import taxes on
OL,8,Fmarmalade, gherkins and more than 100
OL,9,Fproducts in a move to give families
OL,10,F"breathing space" with the cost of
OL,11,Fliving in the Budget.
OL,13,FOn Wednesday the chancellor will
OL,14,Fpromise a fresh series of "everyday
OL,15,Ffixes" to ease the pressure on
OL,16,Fhouseholds.
OL,18,FThe measures will also include an end
OL,19,Fto the so-called cliff-edge for those
OL,20,Freceiving carer's allowance payments
OL,21,Fand higher tax-free mileage rates being
OL,22,Fmade permanent.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
